  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in minced garlic and cook another minute until fragrant.",
    "Add tomato paste, cumin, coriander, smoked paprika, cinnamon, oregano, bay leaf, and vanilla bean paste; cook for 2 minutes to toast the spices.",
    "Pour in diced tomatoes, stirring to combine, and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add drained chickpeas, lemon juice, salt, and pepper; reduce heat to low and simmer uncovered for 15-20 minutes, allowing flavors to meld.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning; remove bay leaf.",
    "Ladle the tagine into bowls, garnish with chopped parsley if desired.",
    "Serve hot with crusty gluten‑free bread or over rice."
  ],
